@title: A field that becomes enabled can be filled
STEP 1: Wait, then fill
    NAVIGATE to @SITE@/disabled.html
    CLICK the 'Enable the field' button
    WAIT FOR 'Edit Field' to be enabled
    FILL 'Edit Field' field with 'hello'
    PRESS ENTER
    VERIFY that 'Value changed to: hello' is present
DONE.
